<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-PROFILE OF WORLD DECATHLON CHAMPION DVORAK.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-PROFILE OF WORLD DECATHLON CHAMPION DVORAK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Profile of Tomas Dvorak, who won the world decathlon title on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Born May 11, 1972. Dukla Praha. Czechoslovakia.</p>
<p>Won the European title in Helsinki 1995.</p>
<p>Set four personal bests on his way to taking the Olympic bronze in Atlanta last year.</p>
<p>A soldier by profession, he is married to Gabriela Vanova, the daughter of his coach.</p>
</text>
